      "id": "sort_label",
      "label": "Sort label",
      "default": "SORT BY"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_per_page",
      "label": "Products per page",
      "min": 3,
      "max": 36,
      "step": 3,
      "default": 9
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_rating",
      "label": "Show product rating",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Requires a product rating metafield (e.g. from a reviews app)"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Filters"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The sidebar renders whatever filters are enabled in the Search & Discovery app. Colour groups need a swatch (product option or metaobject) to show as chips."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Every group is multi-select: several values can be ticked in one group and across groups, and the grid updates in place without reloading the page."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "On phones and tablets the sidebar opens as a drawer. These two labels are the drawer's footer buttons and the chip that clears the active filters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "apply_label",
      "label": "Drawer apply button",
      "default": "Show results"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "clear_label",
      "label": "Clear filters label",
      "default": "Clear all"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Tag filter groups"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Material, Player Level, Playing Style, Weight and Rating are carried as prefixed product tags (\"Material: Carbon Fiber\"), because Shopify intersects multiple values of a metafield filter but ORs multiple tags - and multi-select only means something if the values are ORed. Enable the Product tags filter in Search & Discovery for these to appear."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "split_tag_filter",
      "label": "Split the tag filter into groups",
      "default": true,
      "info": "Renders one accordion group per tag prefix, with the prefix stripped off each label"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Sidebar order"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "filter_group_order",
      "label": "Filter group order",
